agnesium, Brokkolisprossen, Chrom, Zitronenmelisse und entzündungshemmenden Wirkstoffen wie Ingwer und Kurkuma und fördert eine langfristige Unterstützung des Zyklus und des hormonellen Gleichgewichts.“  </p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:Rd1r2:-trigger-acc40385-1f5e-4d60-ae2f-0ca14f7dfcb53" id="radix-:Rd1r2:-content-acc40385-1f5e-4d60-ae2f-0ca14f7dfcb53" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="1666f6e1-0c43-433f-8e64-c2eda31fc773" class="r-1fxflwq"><picture data-rid="28674ae4-e251-497b-8e0d-87caabfceaa3" class="r-lxhxhk"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/1_2_aaa7a350-73cd-4404-ba37-07284d15cb20.webp?v=1737642708&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" alt="A person outdoors holding a stethoscope while smiling." class="r-1kdp8y4" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="236ce1bf-6124-489f-8b9a-64ad9e80b549" class="r-e1ms15"><div data-rid="876c7fa5-f363-4248-a90c-bff5064a770a" class="r-1duwsha alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontsize:22px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c